// The quit-requested state play() (game/core/engine/mb.id) needs to end its
// own loop in a case: mb_setup alone never sets it (term_key() always
// returns -1 headlessly, so 'q' is never read), and play()'s real loop has
// no other way to stop -- see mb.id's note on why play/start are cased only
// through this.
quit_setup() {
  mb_setup();
  gs_set(7, 1);
} return void;
():()
():() then eprints:("")

// Non-zero height/velocity/tick -- the state reset_phys (clearstate.id)
// needs to prove it actually zeroes them, which mb_setup's own already-zero
// defaults could never distinguish from doing nothing.
dirty_setup() {
  mb_setup();
  gs_set(1, 5);
  gs_set(2, 3);
} chain () {
  gs_set(4, 7);
} return void;
():()
():() then eprints:("")
